# System Architecture Diagram

A comprehensive block diagram should show:

## Main Components
1. **ESP32 Microcontroller** (Central hub)
   - Serial communication interface
   - GPIO management
   - Timer/interrupt handling

2. **Sensor Subsystem**
   - DHT22 (Temperature & Humidity) on GPIO 4
   - LDR Light Sensor on GPIO 34 (analog)
   - Data processing pipeline

3. **Actuator Subsystem**
   - Heater relay (GPIO 5)
   - Cooler relay (GPIO 18)
   - Fan relay (GPIO 19)
   - Water pump relay (GPIO 21)
   - Humidifier relay (GPIO 22)

4. **Display**
   - LCD 16x2 (4-bit parallel mode)
   - Status indication

5. **Control System**
   - Central Controller (Python)
   - Temperature RL Agent
   - Humidity RL Agent
   - Conflict Resolver

## Data Flow
- Sensors → ESP32 → Serial → Python Controller
- Python Controller → RL Agents → Decisions
- Decisions → Conflict Resolver → ESP32
- ESP32 → Relay Control → Actuators

## Power Distribution
- 3.3V logic supply
- 12V actuator supply
- Ground plane

Image format: PNG, 1920x1440px
